[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the perimetral seal on the door frame near the front pillar\ntrim.</p><p>2. Release the pillar cover from the retainers using the special\ntool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019295.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>Refit the pillar trim to the retainers.</p><p>Fit the sealing strip around the door frame.</p>"],[2047,127,134217728,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Prise off the cover, taking care not to damage the trim.</p><p>2. Undo the pillar trim retaining bolt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019296.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,134217728,"<p>1. Remove the perimetral seal on the door frame near the front pillar\ntrim.</p><p>2. Release the pillar trim (2a) lowering it gently to release the\ninner retainers (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019297.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,134217728,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>Position the trim and do up the inner retainers.</p><p>Fit the sealing strip around the door frame.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Fit the cover.</p>"]]